  "Bought at market": "Acheté au marché",
  "Sold at market": "Vendu au marché",
  "Recorded since {time}: the window reaches back further than the recording.": "Enregistré depuis {time} : la période remonte plus loin que l'enregistrement.",
  "Passive buyers took ${value} of market sells": "Les acheteurs passifs ont absorbé ${value} de ventes au marché",
